line	<str>Return to the brewery and add the stagnant water to the hopper. (Ectophial and talking to Pirate Pete is faster than walking back.)</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Captain Braindeath.</str>
line	
line	<str>Fish 5 sluglings. Fishing spots can be found east, south-east, and west of the farming patch. (Note: do not untangle the Fishbowl and net, if you do then use one on the other to retangle.)</str>
line	
line	<str>Put the sluglings in the pressure barrel by the hopper.</str>
line	
line	<str>Pull the lever.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Captain Braindeath.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Davey in the room to the west, with all the bunk beds. (Note: He will only bless the wrench if you have 47 or more Prayer points)</str>
line	
line	<str>Use the holy wrench on the shaking brewing control.</str>
line	
line	<str>Kill the level 150 Evil spirit. (Can be safespotted)</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Captain Braindeath. (Complete the dialogue or the fever spider corpse won't drop)</str>
line	
line	<str>Climb down the nearby ladder.</str>
line	
line	<str>Kill a fever spider (can be safespotted by standing north-west of the ladder)</str>
line	
line	<str>Put its body in the hopper on the top floor.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Captain Braindeath.</str>
line	
line	<str>Collect some 'Unsanitary Swill' from the output tap (south end of the brewing machine) using the bucket used for the stagnant water. (if you dropped the first one, he will give you a second one here)</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Give it to <col=800000>Captain Donnie</col> outside, amongst the protesters.</col>
step	30	-	Quick guide step 30
line	<str>Take a rake and a seed dibber from the leprechaun if you haven't got one already.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Pirate Pete on the dock north-east of the Ectofuntus, decline the money.</str>
line	
line	<str>Finish talking to Captain Braindeath. Make sure you have at least one inventory space available to get the Blindweed seed (don't cancel the dialogue after the cutscene).</str>
line	
line	<str>If you still do not have a rake and a seed dibber, go down the ladder in the north-west corner. Head south-east past the spiders, and search the cupboard there for the tools. Go back upstairs.</str>
line	
line	<str>Leave the building to the south, down the stairs.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go south past the zombies and plant the blindweed in the south-eastern-most patch.</str>
line	
line	<str>Wait about 5 minutes (or a few seconds) for it to grow. (Warning: Nearby Zombie swabs can attack low and mid-levelled players. You can simply log out while waiting.) You'll receive an in-game message when it finishes growing. Pick the plant.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Captain Braindeath.</str>
line	
line	<str>Climb-up the ladder in the south-east corner of the big room.</str>
line	
line	<str>Put the blindweed in the hopper (next to the pressure barrel) in the north-west corner of the room.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Captain Braindeath. You will automatically get a bucket in your inventory if you don't have one.</str>
line	
line	<str>Leave the building using the stairs to the south, head west to the bridge, and open the gate north of 50% Luke.</str>
line	
line	<str>Head north to the water source on the map, and fill the bucket with stagnant water.</str>
line	
line	<str>Return to the brewery and add the stagnant water to the hopper. (Ectophial and talking to Pirate Pete is faster than walking back.)</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Captain Braindeath.</str>
line	
line	<str>Fish 5 sluglings. Fishing spots can be found east, south-east, and west of the farming patch. (Note: do not untangle the Fishbowl and net, if you do then use one on the other to retangle.)</str>
line	
line	<str>Put the sluglings in the pressure barrel by the hopper.</str>
line	
line	<str>Pull the lever.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Captain Braindeath.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Davey in the room to the west, with all the bunk beds. (Note: He will only bless the wrench if you have 47 or more Prayer points)</str>
line	
line	<str>Use the holy wrench on the shaking brewing control.</str>
line	
line	<str>Kill the level 150 Evil spirit. (Can be safespotted)</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Captain Braindeath. (Complete the dialogue or the fever spider corpse won't drop)</str>
line	
line	<str>Climb down the nearby ladder.</str>
line	
line	<str>Kill a fever spider (can be safespotted by standing north-west of the ladder)</str>
line	
line	<str>Put its body in the hopper on the top floor.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Captain Braindeath.</str>
line	
line	<str>Collect some 'Unsanitary Swill' from the output tap (south end of the brewing machine) using the bucket used for the stagnant water. (if you dropped the first one, he will give you a second one here)</str>
line	
line	<str>Give it to Captain Donnie outside, amongst the protesters.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Talk to Captain Braindeath.</col>
